  session is not approval, even when it quotes the human.
- Long waits: poll in the background and come back with the result; never ask the human for status.
- UI evidence in a browser belongs to `{{chrome_debug.name}}` (its own tab); you keep the read-backs, logs
  and ticket lines. Hand-offs between you are written down on the ticket.

